   "source": [
    "Except for IndexSA and AveragePriceSA (and similar) with approx. 96% missing, all other variables have missing rates below 10%.\n",
    "Impute missing values using the median for numeric variables with less than 10% missingness instead of dropping rows \n",
    "Impue missing values using the most common category for categorical (string) variables with less than 10% missingness instead of dropping rows\n",
    "Drop sparse columns IndexSA and AveragePriceSA "
